<title>NORWAY: Norsk Hydro buys EniChem fertiliser unit.</title>
<headline>Norsk Hydro buys EniChem fertiliser unit.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norsk Hydro ASA said on Thursday it had agreed with EniChem to buy the Italian group's fertiliser unit at Terni Industrie Chimiche SpA.</p>
<p>No price was given for the deal.</p>
</text>
